        "point": "n = 0 witness",
        "statement": "Rotating by 0 is the identity, so `VTask.IsRotated l l` is always true (reflexivity).",
        "note": "Every list is trivially a rotation of itself."
      },
      {
        "point": "n beyond length",
        "statement": "Values of `n` greater than or equal to `l.length` wrap around modulo the length, introducing no extra cases; the existential ranges over all of ℕ without restriction.",
